{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":532123,"ns":0,"title":"Anti-twister mechanism","extract":"The anti-twister or antitwister mechanism is a method of connecting a flexible link between two objects, one of which is rotating with respect to the other, in a way that prevents the link from becoming twisted. The link could be an electrical cable or a flexible conduit.","description":"Special way of connecting two objects through flexible links","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}